	//Actual lyrics
	"\1\b[20]%(note1)Ooooo be my racing baby~%(note2)\n\n %(note1)Ooooo be my winning bet~%(note2)"
	"\1\b[20]%(note1)Watch them zip across the track~%(note2)\n\n %(note1)Oh, these snails are such a thrill~%(note2)" //resisting the urge to put "also a delicious snack"...
	"\1\b[20]%(note1)Ohh look on down the line~%(note2)\n\n %(note1)Here comes that shiny shell, claiming the fastest time~%(note2)"
