	//DJ
	_somesnail = SnailNameGenerator(,"not alliteration")
	"\1\b[22]And now for something special, folks! A little snail called %(_somesnail) is here in the studio with us today, and it's going to perform a song that it wrote itself. Take it away, %(_somesnail)!\n\n %(note1)%(note1)%(note1)%(note1)%(note1)%(note1)%(note1)%(note1)%(note1)%(note1)\n\n \f[italic,1]\![embed,OnSnailSong]\f[italic,default]\n\n %(note1)%(note1)%(note1)%(note1)%(note1)%(note1)%(note1)%(note1)%(note1)%(note1)\_w[2000]\n\n Aw, that was lovely. Thank you for that wonderful performance, %(_somesnail), and we hope you'll come back to the studio again someday to sing another song!"
	"\1\b[22]It's that time of the day again, folks, it's time to put in your music requests! Starting next hour, I play nothing but what you send me; you control the show!\n\n Get out those phones, send me a message on the snailernet, use our app; whatever way you wanna get it to me, get it to me and I'll play out the snail tunes you've been itching for."
	"\1\b[20]How's everyone feeling out there? These tunes are hot today, yowza!\n\n We'll get right back to it in a moment, but I want to take this time to remind everyone about the %(charityevent)"
