	"\![set,balloonwait,2]Sluuuuuuuurp.\![set,balloonwait,1] Ahh..."
	"Pop. Pop. Pop. Pop."
	"\![set,balloonwait,2]Shhrrrrrrr.\![set,balloonwait,1]"
	"\![set,balloonwait,2]Fwshhhhhh.\![set,balloonwait,1]"
	"Splut. Splut."
	"Bop. Bop. Bop. Bop."
	"\![set,balloonwait,2]Shrrrrrrrip.\![set,balloonwait,1]"
	"Scratch scratch. Scratch scratch scratch."
	"Skritch skritch skritch."
	"\![set,balloonwait,2]Shhhhhhvv.\![set,balloonwait,1]"
